  "scope": "Ten project results with their assumptions. The fixed positive angular law has a sharp relative truncation error for each positive order and a four-moment threshold. For five recorded robot tasks, the donor experiment and full sensor traces identify shared records. A common empirical source law for two targets gives equal informative MGW redundancy and distinct signed redundancies. The figures, source studies and exact finite certificates are inputs to this edition.",
